Optional AGPL dependency
------------------------
The optional `[extract]` extra installs PyMuPDF (https://pymupdf.readthedocs.io),
which is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or a
commercial license from Artifex Software, Inc. It is used only by
`rmf refs extract` to regenerate the committed text extractions under
`references/text/`.

- The default install (`make bootstrap`, `uv sync`) does NOT install PyMuPDF.
- It is installed only when you opt in with `EXTRACT=1 make bootstrap`
  (or `uv sync --extra extract`). CI opts in.
- The `[extract]` extra also installs pdfplumber (MIT) as a fallback extractor.

If AGPL terms are unacceptable for your use, do not install the extra; the
committed extractions remain usable without it.

